      "exact_marker": "We have open-sourced  **Hunyuan-A13B-Pretrain** , **Hunyuan-A13B-Instruct** , **Hunyuan-A13B-Instruct-FP8** , **Hunyuan-A13B-Instruct-GPTQ-Int4** on Hugging Face.",
